# What git tolerates locally must not reach a build context: a build context becomes a
# layer, and a layer becomes an artefact someone else pulls.

# --- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
secrets/

# --- Not needed to run -----------------------------------------------------------------
tests/
docs/
*.md
.github/
.pre-commit-config.yaml
Makefile

# --- Local noise -----------------------------------------------------------------------
.git/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.claude/
.idea/
.vscode/
build/
dist/

# NOTE: data/ is *not* excluded. The pack is synthetic and the image needs it to run with
# one command. `*.md` above is anchored at the root, so the pack's own Markdown records
# (data/meridian_case_pack/people/*.md …) are kept.
